{
  "name": "rhuanssauro-WeatherMeter",
  "description": "A personal page that loads weather and sea state for one latitude and longitude. Each load covers the 15 days before today and today through the next 14 days, and the window can be saved as CSV or PDF. Condition flags mark rain, cloud, gusts, thunderstorms, and offshore sea state. They are not a link budget and not a navigation aid. Nothing is fetched until Load 30 days is pressed.",
